NEXUS:

It's an artifactory storage service.
used to store artifacts on the rep. (.JAR, .WAR,.EAR)
Nexus server --> Repo --> Artifact
We can use this server to rollback in real time.
It requires t2.medium  1 cpu and 2 gb of RAM
Nexus uses Java 1.8.0
PORT: 8081

ALTERNATIVES: JFROPG, S3, -----

